/-!
# Direct consumer of the cycle-memory platform-gate paid U8 update

This certificate consumes the cofinal platform memory obstruction, its exact
cross-occurrence UBI-lineage transporter, the revised channel candidate and
the literal right Payment visit.  The platform face shares the established
new-only first row and successor, preserves the observer-submission authority
and old paid channels, and is consumed by its own canonical U8 runtime.
-/

